  "notes": "Restaurant Tycoon 3 is a restaurant building game from Ultraw, who also made Restaurant Tycoon 2. You build and decorate your own restaurant, cook dishes and click to serve customers, then spend what you earn on more tables, better kitchen gear and staff. Your restaurant keeps making money while you are offline, and the current Band Update adds live music featuring Glass Animals.\n\nCodes come in two types. Short boost codes like Wavey raise your earnings by 20% for 10 minutes, while creator codes named after YouTubers unlock a trophy, poster and statue to decorate with. The boosts are the most useful, so redeem them when you have time to keep playing and serving. Boost codes get swapped out often, usually within a week or two, so older ones stop working fast.",
