  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Why does brazil44 not work anymore in Restaurant Tycoon 3?",
      "a": "Boost codes only last a short time before a new one replaces them. brazil44, fall2026 and alora have all expired, so try Wavey or Visionary instead."
    },
    {
      "q": "What do the creator codes give?",
      "a": "Each creator code unlocks three decorations with that YouTuber's name on them: a trophy, a poster and a statue. They are for decorating and do not raise your earnings."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is the code 01 real?",
      "a": "Yes. It is the creator code for janisjanis01 and gives that creator's trophy, poster and statue. Type just the two digits, zero then one."
    }
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Stay active in your first sessions. Clicking to serve customers quickly is a big part of your early income, before your restaurant is built up.",
    "Add tables and seats before spending on decorations. More places to sit means more customers at once, and the decor can wait until your income is steady.",
    "Open the Upgrades menu often. The game's page points players there for the delivery feature, and new upgrades are where most of your growth comes from.",
    "Your restaurant earns money while you are offline, so spend your cash on upgrades before you leave instead of letting it sit unused."
  ],
  "useRewards": "The two boost codes, Wavey and Visionary, each give 20% more earnings for 10 minutes. Redeem one, keep serving until it runs out, then redeem the other for about 20 minutes of boosted income in a row. The creator codes only unlock a trophy, poster and statue, so they never change your earnings. Use them whenever you want to fill an empty corner of your restaurant.",
  "aliases": [
    "rt3"
  ],
  "codeChannels": "The Restaurant Tycoon 3 Discord server and Ultraw's social accounts. Creator codes come from YouTubers who partner with the game."
